  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of Services - Resource Developmental Expenditure Limit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This support is to fund additional consultancy support for Prospero transitioning to a new delivery model. This is necessary due to the high degree of technical complexity in managing SPVs and the need to proactively manage for VFM to optimise our support to building Zambia&#x2019;s SME sector and transformation of Zambia&#x2019;s investment environment.</narrative>
  </description>
